  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Shadowmaw alternate species ability.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Up to your Charisma modifier times per day when you save against a spell with your shadowmaw ability you may forgo your temporary hit point gain to recharge your own supernatural powers. You may recharge a spell-slot, regain a lost spell, or gain power points. The effect you resisted must be a level higher than the spell or spell-slot you wish to regain. You instead can gain power points equal to the 2 time a spell of one level lower than the spell you resisted. If instead you are a sphere caster with access to the dark sphere you may regain one spell point if the spell is higher than half your caster level.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/shadow-fey#toc23\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
